<description>&lt;p&gt;Communal clashes continue in Jonglei, where an attack on Miny Island left dozens missing and a cattle keeper was injured by a wild animal in Aweil North, while a truck driver was killed on the Juba-Nimule road. The UN special envoy is urging President Kiir and other leaders to choose consensus over confrontation, and the African Union has voiced deep concerns about the renewed clashes. Uganda defended its military deployment in South Sudan and the US ambassador met with Kiir to discuss communal conflicts. A pastor received death threats in a refugee camp and a Juba Dal activist was hacked to death in Cumilla. Two battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxPV3c5dVRRcDBQSkl3azc5Z2drTTFlMjFCYllTY3ZTY0JST3g0bjlVb2VKYkRzMHdwbkNuZXVDTUJ2ZkNCS1FBeERoMFh5UUo5cFBCdTMyWmVBQlE1Slp5M251SEhjV0hkbk9lMFdrSDFOMWlOY1pnQmFvaEJXaEExaTdmSjhLdVpRblp4YU5paWc0VzA?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYEFVX3lxTE5WN080ekVZUUw4cU84aHgtX1U4Q0xTR1A4N01mUlRzejZ0bzVtUUxrWm9mZkpoUkVJSHJ0VlRFVFlfd1BtazFhWXpMMUNlWnl2eW1aNTE5MVFQLW5rQWxietIBZkFVX3lxTE1L